{"step_index":263,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-12T01:00:49Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-12T08:00:49+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-12T08:00:50+07:00\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\n\r\n\r\n======================================================================\r\n### METRO 2033 - # CHAPTER 1\r\n======================================================================\r\n\r\nMETRO 2033\r\n\r\n# BAB 1\r\n\r\nSubjudul: Ujung Dunia\r\n\r\nPyotr: \"Siapa di sana? Artyom, coba lu cek!\"\r\n\r\nArtyom bangkit malas-malasan dari dekat api unggun. Dia memindahkan senapan mesinnya dari punggung ke dada, lalu melangkah ke arah kegelapan. Dia berdiri tepat di batas cahaya, mengokang senjatanya sekeras dan seancam mungkin, lalu membentak kasar:\r\n\r\nArtyom: \"Berhenti! Sebut sandi!\"\r\n\r\nDari kegelapan yang tadinya terdengar suara gesekan aneh dan bisikan samar, sekarang terdengar langkah kaki cepat yang buru-buru menjauh. Sesuatu lari ke kedalaman terowongan, ketakutan gara-gara suara bentakan Artyom dan kokangan senjatanya. Artyom buru-buru balik ke dekat api dan melapor ke Pyotr Andreevich:\r\n\r\nArtyom: \"Nggak ada yang maju. Nggak ada jawaban juga, langsung ngibrit.\"\r\n\r\nPyotr: \"Tolol lu! Kan udah dibilang berkali-kali. Kalo nggak nyaut, langsung tembak! Lu kira siapa yang barusan lewat? Bisa aja the Dark Ones makin deket!\" \r\n\r\n[Catatan: Dark Ones (Si Hitam) - Mutan misterius pasca-kiamat nuklir yang kebal hawa dingin dan memiliki kemampuan telepati berbahaya.]\r\n\r\nArtyom: \"Bukan... kayaknya bukan manusia. Suaranya aneh banget. Langkah kakinya juga bukan langkah orang. Lu pikir gue nggak tahu suara langkah kaki manusia kayak gimana? Lagian, kapan coba the Dark Ones pernah kabur kayak gitu? Lu tahu sendiri kan, Pyotr Andreevich. Akhir-akhir ini mereka langsung nerobos maju tanpa ragu. Kemarin aja patroli diserang cuma pake tangan kosong, mereka maju nerjang berondongan senapan mesin. Lah yang barusan langsung kabur... Kayak binatang ketakutan.\"\r\n\r\nPyotr: \"Halah, lu kebanyakan mikir, Artyom! Lu punya perintah, jalanin aja, nggak usah sotoy. Gimana kalo itu tadi mata-mata? Sekarang mereka tahu personel kita cuma dikit di sini, tahu amunisi apa aja yang harus mereka bawa... Bisa aja mereka langsung habisi kita sekarang cuma buat senang-senang. Leher kita digorok, terus seluruh stasiun dibantai kayak di Polezhaevskayaâ€”dan itu semua cuma gara-gara lu nggak nembak tikus sialan tadi! Awas lu ya, lain kali gue suruh lu lari ngejar mereka ke dalem terowongan!\"\r\n\r\nArtyom merinding membayangkan terowongan di atas meter ke-700. Mengerikan cuma untuk dibayangkan saja. Nggak ada yang punya nyali buat pergi ke utara melewati meter ke-700. Regu patroli cuma berani maju sampai meter ke-500. Begitu mereka menyinari tiang perbatasan dengan lampu sorot di lori dan yakin nggak ada bangsat mutan yang lewat, mereka langsung buru-buru balik. Bahkan tim intaiâ€”orang-orang berotot mantan marinirâ€”bakal berhenti di meter ke-680. Mereka bakal menyembunyikan bara rokok di telapak tangan, berdiri mematung sambil terus memantau lewat kacamata night-vision. Setelah itu, mereka mundur pelan-pelan tanpa bersuara, mata tetap tertuju ke terowongan, tanpa pernah sekalipun membelakangi arah gelap itu.\r\n\r\nSekarang mereka lagi jaga di meter ke-450, lima puluh meter dari tiang perbatasan. Perbatasan itu cuma dicek sekali sehari, dan inspeksi hari ini sudah selesai beberapa jam lalu. Pos mereka sekarang adalah pos paling luar. Binatang-binatang buas yang tadinya kabur gara-gara patroli sebelumnya pasti sudah mulai merayap mendekat lagi. Makhluk-makhluk itu tertarik pada api dan manusia...\r\n\r\nArtyom duduk lagi di tempatnya, lalu bertanya:\r\n\r\nArtyom: \"Sebenernya apa yang kejadian di Polezhaevskaya?\"\r\n\r\nMeski dia sudah tahu cerita horor itu dari para pedagang di stasiun, dia selalu ingin mendengarnya lagi. Mirip bocah yang kecanduan dengar cerita hantu soal mutan tanpa kepala atau monster penculik anak.\r\n\r\n"}
{"step_index":264,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-12T01:00:50Z","input_tokens":2363,"cache_read_tokens":169907,"output_tokens":4263,"tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/usr/bin/env node\n/**\n * ============================================================================\n * 🚇 METRO 2033 & NOVEL TRANSLATOR - DRAG & DROP CLI (DIRECT & TO-THE-POINT)\n * ============================================================================\n * Updated:\n * - Chunk-level caching in `.chunks_cache/[chapter_id]/`\n * - Resumes mid-chapter if interrupted, preventing any loss of work.\n * - Full chapter checkpointing in `[novel]_checkpoint.json`.\n * ============================================================================\n */\n\nimport fs from 'node:fs';\nimport path from 'node:path';\nimport readline from 'node:readline';\nimport http from 'node:http';\nimport { execSync } from 'node:child_process';\n\nconst CONFIG = {\n  proxyUrl: 'http://127.0.0.1:20128/v1/chat/completions',\n  model: 'ag/gemini-3.8-flash',\n  apiKey: 'sk-2e591994696af18e-71ijj7-14263abd',\n  maxChunkChars: 12000,\n  concurrency: 4\n};\n\nconst SYSTEM_PROMPT = `Kamu adalah penerjemah novel profesional ke Bahasa Indonesia dengan gaya langsung (Direct & To-The-Point).\n\nTUGAS UTAMA (PRIORITAS TERTINGGI):\n1. Terjemahkan CONTENT ke bahasa Indonesia yang santai sehari-hari, gaul, to-the-point, gamblang, dan vulgar/kasar jika sesuai situasi keras (contoh: suasana bunker militer, ancaman mutan, panik).\n2. HINDARI METAFORA PUITIS / KATA-KATA BERBUNGA-BUNGA LEBAY. Sampaikan fakta kejadian, suasana, dan deskripsi secara langsung, padat, dan jelas (tell, don't show bertele-tele). Jangan muter-muter.\n3. Dialog menggunakan \"gue/lu\" atau umpatan santai/kasar sehari-hari yang sesuai emosi karakter tanpa dibuat-buat.\n4. FORMAT DIALOG KONSISTEN: Selalu sertakan NAMA SPEAKER pada dialog:\n   Nama: \"Isi dialog...\"\n   (Contoh: Artyom: \"Sialan, apaan tuh di lorong?!\", Pyotr: \"Bego lu, buruan tembak!\").\n5. JANGAN mengubah alur kejadian, aksi, atau informasi plot penting.\n6. SOURCE ADALAH RAJA. Jangan memotong atau menambah kejadian baru.\n7. NOTES / KOMENTAR: Tambahkan catatan singkat dalam tanda kurung siku [Catatan: ...] HANYA jika ada istilah senjata, faksi, stasiun, atau monster yang butuh penjelasan singkat bagi pembaca awam.\n\nOutput HANYA teks hasil terjemahan yang rapi tanpa kata pengantar atau penutup.`;\n\ninterface Chapter {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  text: string;\n}\n\nfunction extractEpubChapters(epubPath: string): Chapter[] {\n  console.log('📦 Membaca isi file EPUB...');\n  const tempDir = path.join(path.dirname(epubPath), '.temp_epub_extract');\n  if (fs.existsSync(tempDir)) fs.rmSync(tempDir, { recursive: true, force: true });\n  fs.mkdirSync(tempDir, { recursive: true });\n\n  try {\n    execSync(`tar -xf \"${epubPath}\" -C \"${tempDir}\"`, { stdio: 'pipe' });\n  } catch (err) {\n    throw new Error('Gagal mengekstrak EPUB menggunakan utilitas tar sistem: ' + err);\n  }\n\n  const chapters: Chapter[] = [];\n  function scanDir(dir: string) {\n    const entries = fs.readdirSync(dir, { withFileTypes: true });\n    for (const ent of entries) {\n      const full = path.join(dir, ent.name);\n      if (ent.isDirectory()) {\n        scanDir(full);\n      } else if (/\\.(html|xhtml)$/i.test(ent.name)) {\n        if (/cover|toc|bookmark|titlepage|copyright/i.test(ent.name)) continue;\n        \n        const html = fs.readFileSync(full, 'utf-8');\n        let cleanText = html\n          .replace(/<script\\b[^<]*(?:(?!<\\/script>)<[^<]*)*<\\/script>/gi, '')\n          .replace(/<style\\b[^<]*(?:(?!<\\/style>)<[^<]*)*<\\/style>/gi, '')\n          .replace(/<div class=\"cst\"><b>(.*?)<\\/b><\\/div>/gi, '\\nSubtitle: $1\\n')\n          .replace(/<div class=\"ct\"><b>(.*?)<\\/b><\\/div>/gi, '\\n\\n# $1\\n')\n          .replace(/<h[1-6][^>]*>(.*?)<\\/h[1-6]>/gi, '\\n\\n# $1\\n')\n          .replace(/<p[^>]*>/gi, '\\n')\n          .replace(/<div[^>]*>/gi, '\\n')\n          .replace(/<br\\s*[\\/]?>/gi, '\\n')\n          .replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '')\n          .replace(/&nbsp;/g, ' ')\n          .replace(/&amp;/g, '&')\n          .replace(/&quot;/g, '\"')\n          .replace(/&apos;/g, \"'\")\n          .replace(/&lt;/g, '<')\n          .replace(/&gt;/g, '>')\n          .replace(/\\n\\s*\\n\\s*\\n/g, '\\n\\n')\n          .trim();\n\n        if (cleanText.length > 500) {\n          const lines = cleanText.split('\\n').map(l => l.trim()).filter(Boolean);\n          const title = lines.slice(0, 2).join(' - ') || ent.name;\n          chapters.push({\n            id: path.basename(ent.name, path.extname(ent.name)),\n            title,\n            text: cleanText\n          });\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  scanDir(tempDir);\n  fs.rmSync(tempDir, { recursive: true, force: true });\n  chapters.sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id, undefined, { numeric: true, sensitivity: 'base' }));\n  return chapters;\n}\n\nfunction extractTxtChapters(txtPath: string): Chapter[] {\n  const content = fs.readFileSync(txtPath, 'utf-8');\n  const lines = content.split('\\n');\n  const chapters: Chapter[] = [];\n  let currentChap: Chapter | null = null;\n  let currentLines: string[] = [];\n  let chIndex = 1;\n\n  for (const rawLine of lines) {\n    const line = rawLine.trim();\n    const isHeading = /^(CHAPTER|BAB|PROLOG|EPILOGUE|EPILOG)\\b/i.test(line);\n\n    if (isHeading && line.length < 100) {\n      if (currentChap && currentLines.length > 0) {\n        currentChap.text = currentLines.join('\\n').trim();\n        chapters.push(currentChap);\n      }\n      currentChap = {\n        id: `chap_${String(chIndex++).padStart(2, '0')}`,\n        title: line,\n        text: ''\n      };\n      currentLines = [];\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    currentLines.push(rawLine);\n  }\n\n  if (currentChap && currentLines.length > 0) {\n    currentChap.text = currentLines.join('\\n').trim();\n    chapters.push(currentChap);\n  }\n\n  if (chapters.length === 0) {\n    return [{ id: 'full_text', title: path.basename(txtPath), text: content }];\n  }\n\n  return chapters;\n}\n\nfunction splitParagraphSafe(text: string, maxChars: number): string[] {\n  const paragraphs = text.split('\\n');\n  const chunks: string[] = [];\n  let current: string[] = [];\n  let len = 0;\n\n  for (const p of paragraphs) {\n    current.push(p);\n    len += p.length + 1;\n    if (len >= maxChars) {\n      chunks.push(current.join('\\n'));\n      current = [];\n      len = 0;\n    }\n  }\n\n  if (current.length > 0) chunks.push(current.join('\\n'));\n  return chunks;\n}\n\nasync function callLLM(text: string, prevContext: string | null, retry = 3): Promise<string> {\n  let userPrompt = '';\n  if (prevContext) {\n    userPrompt = `[KONTEKS KEJADIAN DARI BAGIAN SEBELUMNYA (HANYA ACUAN HUBUNGAN CERITA, JANGAN DITERJEMAHKAN ULANG)]:\n\"...${prevContext.slice(-350)}...\"\n\n[LANJUTAN CERITA YANG HARUS DITERJEMAHKAN]:\n${text}`;\n  } else {\n    userPrompt = `[AWAL CERITA / BAB]:\n${text}`;\n  }\n\n  const payload = JSON.stringify({\n    model: CONFIG.model,\n    messages: [\n      { role: 'system', content: SYSTEM_PROMPT },\n      { role: 'user', content: userPrompt }\n    ],\n    temperature: 0.6,\n    stream: false\n  });\n\n  const parsedUrl = new URL(CONFIG.proxyUrl);\n\n  for (let attempt = 1; attempt <= retry; attempt++) {\n    try {\n      const resText = await new Promise<string>((resolve, reject) => {\n        const req = http.request({\n          hostname: parsedUrl.hostname,\n          port: parsedUrl.port || 80,\n          path: parsedUrl.pathname,\n          method: 'POST',\n          headers: {\n            'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n            'Authorization': `Bearer ${CONFIG.apiKey}`,\n            'Content-Length': Buffer.byteLength(payload)\n          },\n          timeout: 180000\n        }, (res) => {\n          let d = '';\n          res.on('data', c => d += c);\n          res.on('end', () => {\n            if (res.statusCode && res.statusCode >= 200 && res.statusCode < 300) {\n              try {\n                const j = JSON.parse(d);\n                resolve(j.choices?.[0]?.message?.content || '');\n              } catch (e) {\n                reject(e);\n              }\n            } else {\n              reject(new Error(`HTTP ${res.statusCode}: ${d}`));\n            }\n          });\n        });\n        req.on('error', reject);\n        req.on('timeout', () => req.destroy(new Error('Request Timeout')));\n        req.write(payload);\n        req.end();\n      });\n\n      return resText.trim();\n    } catch (err: any) {\n      console.warn(`⚠️ [Retry ${attempt}/${retry}] ${err.message}`);\n      if (attempt === retry) throw err;\n      await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 2000 * attempt));\n    }\n  }\n  throw new Error('LLM Error');\n}\n\nasync function mapConcurrent<T, R>(items: T[], limit: number, fn: (item: T, i: number) => Promise<R>): Promise<R[]> {\n  const results = new Array<R>(items.length);\n  let nextIdx = 0;\n  const workers = Array.from({ length: Math.min(limit, items.length) }, async () => {\n    while (nextIdx < items.length) {\n      const cur = nextIdx++;\n      results[cur] = await fn(items[cur], cur);\n    }\n  });\n  await Promise.all(workers);\n  return results;\n}\n\nasync function main() {\n  console.log('================================================================');\n  console.log('🚇 NOVEL TRANSLATOR - DRAG & DROP RUNNER (DIRECT & GAUL)');\n  console.log('================================================================');\n\n  let targetFile = process.argv[2];\n\n  if (!targetFile) {\n    const rl = readline.createInterface({ input: process.stdin, output: process.stdout });\n    targetFile = await new Promise<string>(res => {\n      rl.question('👉 Seret & Lepas (Drag & Drop) file .epub atau .txt ke sini lalu tekan ENTER:\\n> ', ans => {\n        rl.close();\n        res(ans.trim().replace(/^[\"']|[\"']$/g, ''));\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  targetFile = path.resolve(targetFile.replace(/^[\"']|[\"']$/g, ''));\n\n  if (!fs.existsSync(targetFile)) {\n    console.error(`❌ File tidak ditemukan: ${targetFile}`);\n    process.exit(1);\n  }\n\n  const ext = path.extname(targetFile).toLowerCase();\n  const baseName = path.basename(targetFile, ext);\n  const dirName = path.dirname(targetFile);\n\n  const outputFile = path.join(dirName, `${baseName} (Terjemahan ID-Direct).txt`);\n  const checkpointFile = path.join(dirName, `${baseName}_checkpoint.json`);\n  const cacheDir = path.join(dirName, `.${baseName}_chunks_cache`);\n\n  if (!fs.existsSync(cacheDir)) {\n    fs.mkdirSync(cacheDir, { recursive: true });\n  }\n\n  console.log(`\\n📁 File Input   : ${targetFile}`);\n  console.log(`📄 File Output  : ${outputFile}`);\n  console.log(`🔖 Checkpoint   : ${checkpointFile}`);\n  console.log(`📂 Chunk Cache  : ${cacheDir}`);\n  console.log(`⚡ Concurrency  : ${CONFIG.concurrency} Workers | Model: ${CONFIG.model}\\n`);\n\n  let chapters: Chapter[] = [];\n  if (ext === '.epub') {\n    chapters = extractEpubChapters(targetFile);\n  } else if (ext === '.txt') {\n    chapters = extractTxtChapters(targetFile);\n  } else {\n    console.error('❌ Format file tidak didukung! Harap masukkan file .epub atau .txt');\n    process.exit(1);\n  }\n\n  console.log(`✅ Berhasil mendeteksi ${chapters.length} Bab dari file.\\n`);\n\n  let checkpoint = { completedIds: [] as string[] };\n  if (fs.existsSync(checkpointFile)) {\n    try {\n      checkpoint = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(checkpointFile, 'utf-8'));\n    } catch {}\n  }\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < chapters.length; i++) {\n    const ch = chapters[i];\n\n    if (checkpoint.completedIds.includes(ch.id)) {\n      console.log(`⏭️  [${i + 1}/${chapters.length}] Lewati Bab: ${ch.title} (Sudah selesai)`);\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    console.log(`----------------------------------------------------------------`);\n    console.log(`📖 [${i + 1}/${chapters.length}] Memproses Bab: ${ch.title} (~${ch.text.length} karakter)`);\n    console.log(`----------------------------------------------------------------`);\n\n    const chapCacheDir = path.join(cacheDir, ch.id);\n    if (!fs.existsSync(chapCacheDir)) {\n      fs.mkdirSync(chapCacheDir, { recursive: true });\n    }\n\n    const chunks = splitParagraphSafe(ch.text, CONFIG.maxChunkChars);\n    console.log(`📦 Dibagi menjadi ${chunks.length} bagian chunk...`);\n\n    const startT = Date.now();\n    const translatedParts = await mapConcurrent(chunks, CONFIG.concurrency, async (chunkText, idx) => {\n      const chunkFile = path.join(chapCacheDir, `chunk_${String(idx + 1).padStart(3, '0')}.txt`);\n\n      // Cek apakah chunk sudah ada di disk cache\n      if (fs.existsSync(chunkFile)) {\n        console.log(`   ⚡ Bagian [${idx + 1}/${chunks.length}] dimuat dari cache lokal.`);\n        return fs.readFileSync(chunkFile, 'utf-8');\n      }\n\n      const prevContext = idx > 0 ? chunks[idx - 1] : null;\n      const tStart = Date.now();\n      const res = await callLLM(chunkText, prevContext);\n      const dur = ((Date.now() - tStart) / 1000).toFixed(1);\n\n      // Simpan langsung chunk ke disk cache\n      fs.writeFileSync(chunkFile, res, 'utf-8');\n      console.log(`   ⚡ Bagian [${idx + 1}/${chunks.length}] selesai (${dur}s) & dicache`);\n      return res;\n    });\n\n    const totalDur = ((Date.now() - startT) / 1000).toFixed(1);\n    console.log(`✅ Bab selesai dalam ${totalDur}s`);\n\n    const chapterOutput = `\\n\\n${'='.repeat(70)}\\n### ${ch.title}\\n${'='.repeat(70)}\\n\\n${translatedParts.join('\\n\\n')}\\n\\n`;\n    fs.appendFileSync(outputFile, chapterOutput, 'utf-8');\n\n    checkpoint.completedIds.push(ch.id);\n    fs.writeFileSync(checkpointFile, JSON.stringify(checkpoint, null, 2), 'utf-8');\n    console.log(`💾 Bab tersimpan ke output dan checkpoint.`);\n  }\n\n  console.log('\\n================================================================');\n  console.log('🎉 PROSES TERJEMAHAN SELESAI!');\n  console.log(`📁 File hasil tersimpan di: ${outputFile}`);\n  console.log('================================================================');\n}\n\nmain().catch(err => {\n  console.error('\\n❌ Terjadi kesalahan fatal:', err);\n  process.exit(1);\n});\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"D:\\JV\\novel yoga\\translate-novel-dragndrop.ts"}}]}
